Type:     gfx/3dobj

This archive contains the model/brushes/surfaces/etc.  Extracting
to a directory called "Projects" in 3D: will avoid any re-direction
requesters.

Everything was created on my 14Mb A3000/25 and the included image
took about four hours to render in High Res/High AA...I really will
have to buy an accelerator card you know!!!

It's all freeware, do what you want with it.  All I ask is that if
you do use it in one of your own projects let me know so I can take
a peek.

Have fun,

Dave.